msgstr ""
"Alt container-query a cheanglaíonn ceannlíne shreabhach le halt réamhrá "
"eirgeanamaíoch."

#: src/Integration/Ecosystem_Bridge.php:211
msgid "Harmonische Typografie im Browser"
msgstr "Clóghrafaíocht chomhchuibhiúil sa bhrabhsálaí"

#: src/Integration/Ecosystem_Bridge.php:212
msgid ""
"Fließende Schriftgrößen zwischen Mobilgerät und Desktop, berechnet aus "
"Basisgröße und musikalischem Intervall."
msgstr ""
"Clómhéideanna sreabhacha idir fón póca agus deasc, ríofa ó bhunmhéid agus "
"eatramh ceoil."

#: src/Integration/Ecosystem_Bridge.php:221
msgid "GenerateBlocks Fluid Scale Section"
msgstr "Alt scála shreabhaigh GenerateBlocks"

#: src/Integration/Ecosystem_Bridge.php:222
msgid ""
"Two-layer GenerateBlocks section (gbp-section + gbp-section__inner) "
"consuming --ms-* and --wm-step-* fluid tokens."
msgstr ""
"Alt dhá shraith GenerateBlocks (gbp-section + gbp-section__inner) le "
"comharthaí --ms-* agus --wm-step-*."

#: src/Integration/Ecosystem_Bridge.php:229
msgid "Modulare Skala mit GenerateBlocks"
msgstr "Scála modúlach le GenerateBlocks"

#: src/Integration/Ecosystem_Bridge.php:232
msgid "Direkte Nutzung der berechneten CSS-Variablen ohne Media-Query-Stufen."
msgstr "Úsáid dhíreach na hathróg CSS ríofa gan bhrisphointí media query."

#: src/Integration/Ecosystem_Bridge.php:254
msgid "Compute Modular Typography Scale"
msgstr "Ríomh Scála Clóghrafach Modúlach"

#: src/Integration/Ecosystem_Bridge.php:255
msgid ""
"Calculates the nine fluid clamp() steps (-2 to +6), line heights and WCAG "
"1.4.4 zoom-safety flags for a base size and ratio."
msgstr ""
"Ríomhann sé na naoi gcéim clamp() shreabhacha (-2 go +6), airde líne agus "
"bratacha súmála WCAG 1.4.4."

